B.aqj=new A.py("The Quiet War","Addiction & compulsive habits","You are not your struggle. The fact that you are still fighting after every fall is not weakness \u2014 it is the proof of your iman. Allah does not count your falls; He counts your returns.","\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f")
B.aqi=new A.py("Between Two Hearts","Marriage & relationships","The best of homes had hard days too. The Prophet \ufdfa was called the best of husbands \u2014 and his house still knew tears, silence, and reconciliation. Your marriage is not failing because it struggles; it is alive because you are still here.","\ud83d\udc9e")
B.aqh=new A.py("The House We Grew In","Family wounds",'Some wounds come from the hands that raised us. Yusuf \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645 was betrayed by his own brothers \u2014 and years later said: "No reproach upon you today." Healing here is not pretending it didn\u2019t hurt. It is deciding the hurt stops with you.',"\ud83c\udfe0")
B.aqf=new A.py("The Empty Chair","Grief & loss",'The Prophet \ufdfa wept at the grave of his son and said: "The eye weeps, the heart grieves, and we say only what pleases our Lord." Your tears are not weak faith. They are love with nowhere to go \u2014 and Allah gathers every one of them.',"\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f")
B.aqg=new A.py("The Son, The Father, The Husband","A space for men who carry quietly",'You were taught to carry, not to speak. The Prophet \ufdfa cried openly, leaned on his companions, and said "I am only a man." Strength was never silence. Put it down here \u2014 no one is watching, and Allah already knows.',"\ud83c\udf11")
B.aqk=new A.py("The Whisper","Waswas, doubt & scrupulosity",'The companions asked the Prophet \ufdfa about the whispers that disturbed them, and he said: "That is clear faith." The whisper that torments you is not a sign of a sick heart \u2014 it is the sign of a heart Shaytan is angry with. You are not what you think. You are what you choose.',"\ud83c\udf43")
B.a6v=s([B.aqj,B.aqi,B.aqh,B.aqf,B.aqg,B.aqk],A.ad("z<py>"))
